        nei (c == upper[i]) { chozulni dut; }
    }
    keit (weltuxle i := 0; i < 10; i := i + 1) {
        nei (c == digits[i]) { chozulni dut; }
    }
    chozulni eikreit;
iweil
```

Then build cleaned string (lowercase, only alnum), check palindrome by comparing positions.

Since strings support indexing and dushzosh, compare s[i] with s[len-1-i].

```
weltuxle line := lono();
krenul (line <> leitchux) {
