But careful k = -5, m=5: -5/5 = -1, rem 0. shift=0. k=-5 ≡ 0 mod 5 → no rotation. Correct.

k yeil m when m could be... if m==0 skip (no items). Also careful: what if m>0 but k yeil m with the Wochu sign—handled by adding m when negative. Since |k yeil m| < m, adding m once suffices. Good.

